body:
VERY EARLY VERSION!

CPM Ukrainian Translation – this is a pack that translates the Customizable Player Models mod into Ukrainian. The mod is currently translated about 20%, which is still very little.
What has been translated?
- Part of the Modeling Mode;
- The Texturing Mode;
- Part of the Animating Mode;
- The Files section;
- The Edit section.
I would be very grateful if someone would like to help me with this project.
